              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "location": {
                  "line": 6,
                  "heading": "Overview"
                },
                "text": "Cendara University is committed to bridging academic excellence with meaningful career opportunities for its graduates. Our robust campus placement program leverages strong industry connections, comprehensive career services, and dedicated faculty mentorship to ensure that students from all academic backgrounds transition successfully into the workforce, further study, or entrepreneurial ventures."
              }
